    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "7e21de2c-e441-4faf-ada6-2ccf5d317ab9",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "24567c3e-5760-4a28-8171-cde50e4d72a3",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFull programme of included excursions\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EONE FREE PLACE PER 10 PAYING PASSENGERS\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "1a32b5fd-6335-4261-88c4-b8c1dbb08a0c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 4* Albrighton Hall Hotel and Spa. Located in a countryside setting near the village of Albrighton, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, swimming pool and sauna. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "f3c5f008-02b4-42eb-84a5-319a95ce86d4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECompton Verney\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIronbridge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlists Hill Victorian Village\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Shrewsbury\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowis Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBridgnorth\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESevern Valley Railway\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMedieval Stokesay Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAttingham Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "632d2855-e543-4011-8934-3c4883209394",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELudlow Castle - perched on a cliff above the picturesque River Teme, Ludlow Castle dates back to 1085\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt Laurence\u0026#39;s Church - \u0026#39;the Cathedral of the Marches\u0026#39; was largely rebuilt in the 15th century on prosperity derived from the wool trade and incorporates some of England\u0026#39;s finest stained glass windows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMadresfield Court - home to an outstanding collection of furniture, pictures and porcelain while the wonderful library was designed by CR Ashbee, a leading light in the Arts and Crafts movement\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "76789a39-d017-4c09-8189-78def1194c15",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Compton Verney\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 stop at a convenient property en route such as Compton Verney in Warwickshire, a Grade I listed Robert Adam mansion with an outstanding collection of British, Neapolitan, Germanic and Chinese paintings \u2013 check in at the 4* Albrighton Hall Hotel and Spa near the village of Albrighton.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Ironbridge \u0026amp; Blists Hill Victorian Town\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECast in 1779 by Abraham Darby III, the bridge of the small town of Ironbridge remains the great symbol of industrialisation and the success of the iron industry and enthralled visitors who came from all over the world to admire its construction \u2013 time at leisure to explore the Blists Hill Victorian Town, a recreation of life in a Victorian community complete with working factories, shops and cottages authentic to the era.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Shrewsbury \u0026amp; Powis Castle\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Shrewsbury takes in sights such as the Norman castle and St Mary\u2019s Church, dating from 960 AD and boasting one of the tallest spires in England \u2013 Powis Castle contains one of the finest collections of paintings and furniture in Wales while its world famous garden was laid out under the influence of Italian and French styles and retains its original lead statues.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Bridgnorth, Severn Valley Railway \u0026amp; Stokesay Castle\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnce a thriving port along the banks of the River Severn, Charles I declared Bridgnorth as offering \u2018the finest view in all my Kingdom\u2019 \u2013 optional one way 16 mile steam train excursion from Bridgnorth to Kidderminster on the Severn Valley Railway, the best way to explore the beauty of the River Severn \u2013 a perfectly preserved medieval fortified manor house dating back to the 11th century, English Heritage\u2019s Stokesay Castle nestles in a green valley in the heart of the Shropshire countryside.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Attingham Park\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe National Trust\u2019s Attingham Park, an elegant 18th century mansion, is home to a fine collection of ambassadorial silver, Italian furniture and Grand Tour paintings \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
